 {"sha": "38bc83e7f443ecc72b0a1314ebf94e094013458b", "message": "img cleanup", "created_at": "2025-10-18T19:58:05Z", "repo": "SBQC", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "26c0e7b368fbf5ad90fd8754c90e4a0916de0252", "message": "Set cloud rotation to 0 by default for real-time geographic accuracy\n\n- Changed default windSpeedMultiplier from 1.0 to 0.0\n- Clouds now stay in actual real-world positions by default\n- Users can still add rotation animation via Wind Speed slider (0-10x)\n- Added hint text: '0 = Real-time cloud position'\n- Created comprehensive cloud positioning validation document\n- Validated equirectangular projection alignment\n- Confirmed p5.js sphere texture mapping is correct\n- Updated all documentation to reflect new default behavior\n\nBenefits:\n- Geographic accuracy for educational/meteorological use\n- Real correlation between ISS position and actual cloud cover\n- Users can verify cloud patterns match their local weather\n- Optional rotation for visual animation effect", "created_at": "2025-10-18T16:00:08Z", "repo": "SBQC", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0591e12630da2a18e2b9ecc477332934b8b237cb", "message": "Fix cloud refresh interval to match source data frequency\n\n- Changed refresh interval from 15 minutes to 3 hours\n- Source (clouds.matteason.co.uk) updates every 3 hours using EUMETSAT data\n- Reduces unnecessary API calls and bandwidth usage\n- Updated all documentation to reflect correct refresh frequency\n- Added JSDoc comments to route explaining data source and update cycle", "created_at": "2025-10-18T15:47:56Z", "repo": "SBQC", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bbd2326749197de76daa0ef25166467081bd6ed1", "message": "doc", "created_at": "2025-10-18T15:14:02Z", "repo": "SBQC", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0a28914cfeda359613112f5200e78426f76ecb86", "message": "Improve ISS 3D viewer: increase sphere resolution, adjust cloud rotation, add cloud toggle\n\n- Increased Earth and cloud sphere resolution from 24x16 to 64x32 for smoother appearance\n- Changed default cloud rotation speed from 1.5x to 0.2x for more realistic effect\n- Added 'Show Cloud Layer' checkbox to toggle cloud visibility\n- Cloud layer can now be enabled/disabled via UI control", "created_at": "2025-10-18T15:00:51Z", "repo": "SBQC", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2b53afb196e803b4bcde116d13ce658eec31473d", "message": "Merge pull request #104 from WindriderQc/feat/live-cloud-map\n\nfeat: Implement live cloud map in ISS tracker", "created_at": "2025-10-18T14:51:33Z", "repo": "SBQC", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d68cbad22583b44380684931ab1b22b064720c80", "message": "Merge pull request #103 from WindriderQc/feat/live-cloud-map\n\nfeat: Add live cloud map to ISS detector", "created_at": "2025-10-18T14:03:33Z", "repo": "SBQC", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6b79b2b5d5a3836bf366e9e678fb1b26c3712e38", "message": "fixinf look", "created_at": "2025-10-18T07:23:42Z", "repo": "SBQC", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8c66548ec65bd0b6da7ad1a2041515562e23f9f5", "message": "kickass earth", "created_at": "2025-10-18T07:09:55Z", "repo": "SBQC", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ea4d6955fd14ec338e6268a07614f12b960bd409", "message": "Merge pull request #102 from WindriderQc/feat/realistic-iss-detector-earth\n\nRefactor ISS Detector into Classes and Add Wind Slider", "created_at": "2025-10-18T06:58:23Z", "repo": "SBQC", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "89c153ae684b2a0d22ea5e8d6802124e56452269", "message": "Merge pull request #101 from WindriderQc/feat/realistic-iss-detector-earth\n\nRefactor IS